  <title>SET COMPATIBLE Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET COMPATIBLE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET COMPATIBLE Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Purpose</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">Controls compatibility with FoxBASE+ and other xBase languages.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Syntax</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET COMPATIBLE ON | OFF | FOXPLUS | DB4 | &amp;&lt;cMacro&gt;</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Arguments</para>
    <para styleclass="List">ON | FOXPLUS<tab />Enables the compatibility mode.</para>
    <para styleclass="List">OFF | DB4<tab />Disables the compatibility mode.</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">Remarks</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">The value is stored in the runtime state and can be read and changed with the function <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetCompatible.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetCompatible()</link>.</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">See Also</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_SAFETY">SET SAFETY</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetCompatible.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetCompatible()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
